      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REFERENT POWER (1) goes very well this course and distance starting nine times for four wins and four minors. Missed the frame latest (31.43) when fourth over 530m at Angle Park in a Invitation. With a clean break looks hard to beat. AMRON TIGER (4) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.94) at this track behind Terrific Baz in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has performed well from this box with a win and nine minor placings to his name from 12 starts. Must be included in calculations. VICTA KERLE (2) jumped well from this draw last time and was prominent throughout before holding third (23.58) in a Grade 5 at this track over 400m. Leading player again. LONG GULLY ASH (8) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
